HAWK detection rule catalogue — attribution

The patterns in `detect/rules/default.json` are original, written against
this project's threat model (ADR-0005, ADR-0010), but some are informed by
the default rules of the Falco project (https://github.com/falcosecurity/rules),
which the team studied as a reference for how to express filesystem, network
and process behaviour as data rules.

